---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Home
permalink: /
---
{% from "partials/icons.njk" import icon %}

<section class="section container">
  <div class="hero">
    <div class="hero__content">
      <h1 class="hero__title animate-fade-in">
        Hi, I'm Ginestra
      </h1>
      <h2 class="hero__subtitle animate-fade-in animate-fade-in--delay-1">
        Ui/UX &amp; Product Designer
      </h2>
      <p class="hero__text animate-fade-in animate-fade-in--delay-2">
        I'm passionate about building intuitive interfaces that solve real user problems through careful research and thoughtful design. My approach prioritises accessibility and inclusive design principles.
      </p>
      <h3>
        Strategic Leadership &amp; Business Impact
      </h3>
      <p class="hero__text animate-fade-in animate-fade-in--delay-2">
        I partner with executive leadership to shape product direction, connect user needs with business ambitions, and turn complex challenges into strategic opportunities.</p>
      <p class="hero__text animate-fade-in animate-fade-in--delay-2">
        My contribution extends beyond UX execution to influencing mission, vision, and strategy, aligning cross-functional stakeholders, and driving decisions that create measurable value for customers and the business.
      </p>
      <div class="btn-group animate-fade-in animate-fade-in--delay-3">
        <a href="{{ '/work/' | url }}" class="button-link no-bg">
          <span class="btn btn--primary">
            View my work
            {{ icon("arrow-right") }}
          </span>
        </a>
        <a href="{{ '/cv/' | url }}" class="button-link no-bg">
          <span class="btn btn--outline">Download CV</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="hero__visual">
      <div class="hero__avatar animate-fade-in">
        <img src="{{ '/assets/my-shadow.svg' | url }}" alt="Profile">
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section--alt">
  <div class="container">
    <h2 class="feature-grid__heading">What I Do</h2>
    <p>Collaborate with executives and senior stakeholders to influence organisational and product direction. Bridge business ambition, user insights, and design expertise to define meaningful product missions, articulate future experience visions, and translate strategic objectives into actionable priorities.</p>
    <div class="feature-grid">
      <article class="feature-card">
        <div class="feature-card__icon">{{ icon("compass") }}</div>
        <h3 class="feature-card__title">Mission</h3>
        <p class="feature-card__text">Aligning customer needs with business ambitions to define purpose and create meaningful value</p>
      </article>
      <article class="feature-card">
        <div class="feature-card__icon">{{ icon("telescope") }}</div>
        <h3 class="feature-card__title">Vision</h3>
        <p class="feature-card__text">Shaping future product experiences, turning insights and opportunities into a shared direction</p>
      </article>
      <article class="feature-card">
        <div class="feature-card__icon">{{ icon("route") }}</div>
        <h3 class="feature-card__title">Strategy</h3>
        <p class="feature-card__text">Influencing priorities and decisions, connecting design and business goals to drive measurable impact</p>
      </article>
      <article class="feature-card">
        <div class="feature-card__icon">{{ icon("eye") }}</div>
        <h3 class="feature-card__title">UX Research</h3>
        <p class="feature-card__text">Conducting user interviews, usability testing, and analysis to understand user needs</p>
      </article>
      <article class="feature-card">
        <div class="feature-card__icon">{{ icon("code") }}</div>
        <h3 class="feature-card__title">UI Design</h3>
        <p class="feature-card__text">Creating visually appealing interfaces that align with brand identities and user expectations</p>
      </article>
      <article class="feature-card">
        <div class="feature-card__icon">{{ icon("smartphone") }}</div>
        <h3 class="feature-card__title">Accessibility</h3>
        <p class="feature-card__text">Ensuring digital products are usable by people of all abilities and conform to WCAG guidelines</p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
